      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有几句话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when today's record is updated or something needs you (iOS asks once).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的记录更新了、或者有事要你处理时发通知（iOS 会问一次）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ over Bluetooth. It keeps going in the background; if it's interrupted, it picks up where it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经蓝牙大约要 %@。切到后台也会继续；中途断了，下次从断开的地方接着传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次同步之后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Bluetooth for OpenBean in Settings → OpenBean.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「设置 → OpenBean」里允许蓝牙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always on in Heart mode, over Bluetooth, also in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心力模式下一直开着，走蓝牙，在后台也会同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any OpenAI-compatible service: a cloud API or a model on a computer on your network. Summaries, conversation titles and the diary use it. The key is kept in the keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何 OpenAI 兼容的服务：云端 API，或局域网里一台电脑上的模型。摘要、对话段标题和日记都用它。密钥存在钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio on this iPhone is kept for 7 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 上的音频保留 7 天。"
