    "Transcript": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcripts, summaries and the diary are always kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写、摘要和日记一直保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcripts, summaries and the diary are kept. Applies to recordings synced in Heart mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写、摘要和日记都会保留。只对心力模式下同步的录音生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Bluetooth in Control Center or Settings. OpenBean connects as soon as it's on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在控制中心或「设置」里打开蓝牙，打开后 OpenBean 会马上连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Heart mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启心力模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the Heart bean…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等心力豆…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the recorder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等录音豆…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting until the Heart bean is free": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等心力豆空出来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear your Heart bean all day. When it goes back in its case, OpenBean syncs it — even with your iPhone in your pocket — and sorts the day into conversations, a diary and to-dos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整天戴着心力豆，放回充电盒时，OpenBean 会同步它——手机在口袋里也一样——并把这一天整理成对话、日记和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear your Heart bean all day. When it goes back in its case, OpenBean syncs the day, splits it into conversations and writes today's diary and to-dos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "戴着心力豆过一天。放回充电盒后，OpenBean 自动同步、把这一天切成一段段对话，写好今天的日记和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear your recorder all day as a Heart bean. When it goes back in its case, OpenBean takes care of the rest — even with your iPhone in your pocket.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把录音豆当作心力豆整天戴着。放回充电盒后，剩下的交给 OpenBean——手机在口袋里也一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When today's record is updated or a sync needs you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的记录更新了、或者同步需要你处理时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your words go": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你说的话去了哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With 4:00 AM, a conversation at 2 AM still counts as the day before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为凌晨 4 点时，凌晨两点的谈话仍算前一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进行中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works in the background. Keep Bluetooth on, and don't swipe OpenBean away in the app switcher — iOS then stops waking it until you open it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在后台也会工作。请保持蓝牙打开，不要在多任务界面把 OpenBean 划掉——划掉后 iOS 不会再唤醒它，直到你再次打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write diary": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写日记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write the diary for this day": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写这天的日记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes today's diary and to-dos with your LLM service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用你的大模型服务写当天的日记和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing the diary for this day…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在写这天的日记…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change these later in Heart mode settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以后可以在心力模式的设置里改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You won't hear when today's record is updated or a sync needs you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的记录更新、或同步需要你处理时，你不会收到提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your LLM service is a cloud service: the transcript text of each conversation is sent to %@ to write summaries and the diary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的大模型服务在云端：写摘要和日记时，每段对话的转写文字会发送到 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your LLM service runs on your own network (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的大模型服务在你自己的网络里（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
